 11479                        ;/*
 11480                        ; * -----------------------------------------------------------
 11481                        ; * The passive idle task.
 11482                        ; * ----------------------------------------------------------
 11483                        ; *
 11484                        ; * The passive idle task is used for all the additional cores in a SMP
 11485                        ; * system. There must be only 1 active idle task and the rest are passive
