 14306                        ;        /*
 14307                        ;         * PLEASE NOTE:
 14308                        ;         *
  Mon Sep 14 2026  7:48                                                                                                    Page 251


 14309                        ;         * This function is provided for convenience only, and is used by many
 14310                        ;         * of the demo applications.  Do not consider it to be part of the
 14311                        ;         * scheduler.
 14312                        ;         *
 14313                        ;         * vTaskListTasks() calls uxTaskGetSystemState(), then formats part of the
 14314                        ;         * uxTaskGetSystemState() output into a human readable table that
 14315                        ;         * displays task: names, states, priority, stack usage and task number.
